*.bak
*.cache
*.autosave
*.[Cc]ache

# ReSharper
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user

# JustCode
.JustCode

# TeamCity
_TeamCity*

# DotCover
*.dotCover

# AxoCover
.axoCover/*
